      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "NTM has a variety of §5decoration block§r§5s§r to help you decorate your base. Some of these are;\n\n§6Deco Blocks§r, which come for all major materials (§aTungsten, Red Copper, Steel§r) and provide a cheap and easy way to create §escaffolding§r for your base or act as a nice industrial block in general. It\u0027s a §9CT§r block, meaning placing multiple next to one another causes their textures to connect together. They can be found in structures and also §arecycled§r for a bit of extra ingots.\n\n§bPlatemetal§r, which is a cheap and smooth looking decorative block with nice walking sounds, made with just§7 Iron Plates§r. It\u0027s also colorable, and a §9CT§r block just like the deco blocks.\n\nThere are also §6Scaffolding§r,§b Poles§r, §cBeams§r, and§9 Roofs§r, all with models, being good for details. They\u0027re also rotatable so you can use them in a variety of situations.\n\n\u0026qFun Fact§r: Platemetal was my (iris-lgtm\u0027s, so the author of this pack and questbook!) first addition to NTM, and it was PR\u0027ed to NTMMain. I\u0027m surprised it got accepted!",
